enfina: I'm sorry for only listening. I do not know what to say. But I can stay here and listen. If that helps you.
enfina: There is no use trying to count the value of anyone’s soul. And yet these hands have taken lives. In the end there are some situations that do not have an answer and still demand for one. I believe you can never be wrong no matter which answer you choose.
